kes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/axes/_axes.py:Axes._errorevery_to_mask\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/transforms.py:Affine2D\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/transforms.py:_ScaledRotation\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/collections.py:Collection.get_paths\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/collections.py:PathCollection.get_paths\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/collections.py:TriMesh.get_paths\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/collections.py:QuadMesh.get_paths\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/lines.py:Line2D\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/transforms.py:Bbox.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/transforms.py:TransformWrapper.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/transforms.py:Affine2D.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/artist.py:Artist.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/layout_engine.py:LayoutEngine.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/layout_engine.py:TightLayoutEngine.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/layout_engine.py:ConstrainedLayoutEngine.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/dates.py:rrulewrapper.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 galleries/examples/user_interfaces/fourier_demo_wx_sgskip.py:Param.set\n\u2502              \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplotlib/axes/_base.py:_AxesBase._request_autoscale_view\n\u2502              \u2514\u2500\u2500 invokes \u2500\u2500 lib/matplo